{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot Loop is a relaxing incremental dungeon crawler. Dive into short runs that last just seconds, and come back stronger with every upgrade. Each attempt feels rewarding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/b6939f29c35cc2839986682723e677be.apng?t=1769068711\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/b6939f29c35cc2839986682723e677be.poster.avif?t=1769068711\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=34 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/545aaa7c51ac52ef4e430549cda61721.poster.avif?t=1769068711\" width=1170 height=632 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/545aaa7c51ac52ef4e430549cda61721.webm?t=1769068711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/545aaa7c51ac52ef4e430549cda61721.mp4?t=1769068711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore pixel dungeons inspired by the classics of the 80s. Small characters, dark corridors, and charming details create a cozy, nostalgic atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/b9feb6a8b1b5d9fc0272c164a72d9f62.apng?t=1769068711\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/b9feb6a8b1b5d9fc0272c164a72d9f62.poster.avif?t=1769068711\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=38 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/ecf248c36f989fda773b02b7c9f01879.poster.avif?t=1769068711\" width=800 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/ecf248c36f989fda773b02b7c9f01879.webm?t=1769068711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/ecf248c36f989fda773b02b7c9f01879.mp4?t=1769068711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather loot, unlock new skills in your tree, and watch tiny adventurers grow into mighty heroes. Progress is always visible, and every run takes you a step forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/fd553f0d1afa9a498f36ae629e35355d.apng?t=1769068711\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/fd553f0d1afa9a498f36ae629e35355d.poster.avif?t=1769068711\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=33 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/bf743595cffc99463200927894e63121.poster.avif?t=1769068711\" width=1170 height=632 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/bf743595cffc99463200927894e63121.webm?t=1769068711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/bf743595cffc99463200927894e63121.mp4?t=1769068711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no pressure here. Short runs, simple controls, and a chill rhythm let you enjoy the adventure at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/6984d57441afa917d8655f0ba2cf7280.apng?t=1769068711\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/6984d57441afa917d8655f0ba2cf7280.poster.avif?t=1769068711\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=33 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/59c4b5a54539aecb8d336c0631f9fe79.poster.avif?t=1769068711\" width=1170 height=632 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/59c4b5a54539aecb8d336c0631f9fe79.webm?t=1769068711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/59c4b5a54539aecb8d336c0631f9fe79.mp4?t=1769068711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3972320?t=1769068711","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3972320?t=1769068711","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/2b4af6a7ee31e0ff34e4af4dbbf98ac5cdc14830/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769068711","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/2b4af6a7ee31e0ff34e4af4dbbf98ac5cdc14830/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769068711","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4207310,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>About the developer</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi! I'm Patryk, solo developer of Loot Loop. If you like incrementals and dungeon loot, you're in the right place.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot Loop is a relaxing incremental dungeon crawler. Dive into short runs that last just seconds, and come back stronger with every upgrade. Each attempt feels rewarding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/b6939f29c35cc2839986682723e677be.apng?t=1769068711\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/b6939f29c35cc2839986682723e677be.poster.avif?t=1769068711\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=34 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/545aaa7c51ac52ef4e430549cda61721.poster.avif?t=1769068711\" width=1170 height=632 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/545aaa7c51ac52ef4e430549cda61721.webm?t=1769068711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/545aaa7c51ac52ef4e430549cda61721.mp4?t=1769068711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore pixel dungeons inspired by the classics of the 80s. Small characters, dark corridors, and charming details create a cozy, nostalgic atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/b9feb6a8b1b5d9fc0272c164a72d9f62.apng?t=1769068711\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/b9feb6a8b1b5d9fc0272c164a72d9f62.poster.avif?t=1769068711\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=38 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/ecf248c36f989fda773b02b7c9f01879.poster.avif?t=1769068711\" width=800 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/ecf248c36f989fda773b02b7c9f01879.webm?t=1769068711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/ecf248c36f989fda773b02b7c9f01879.mp4?t=1769068711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather loot, unlock new skills in your tree, and watch tiny adventurers grow into mighty heroes. Progress is always visible, and every run takes you a step forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/fd553f0d1afa9a498f36ae629e35355d.apng?t=1769068711\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/fd553f0d1afa9a498f36ae629e35355d.poster.avif?t=1769068711\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=33 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/bf743595cffc99463200927894e63121.poster.avif?t=1769068711\" width=1170 height=632 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/bf743595cffc99463200927894e63121.webm?t=1769068711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/bf743595cffc99463200927894e63121.mp4?t=1769068711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no pressure here. Short runs, simple controls, and a chill rhythm let you enjoy the adventure at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/6984d57441afa917d8655f0ba2cf7280.apng?t=1769068711\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/6984d57441afa917d8655f0ba2cf7280.poster.avif?t=1769068711\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=33 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/59c4b5a54539aecb8d336c0631f9fe79.poster.avif?t=1769068711\" width=1170 height=632 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/59c4b5a54539aecb8d336c0631f9fe79.webm?t=1769068711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/59c4b5a54539aecb8d336c0631f9fe79.mp4?t=1769068711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["BitBrew"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/958eeeee0ffc1e7541ec44572c38af36e786222a/header.jpg?t=1769068711","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai